Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.86,0:00:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven years later,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.90,0:00:08.86,Title,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\fs80\pos(960,810)\bord3\blur2}-1888, London East End-
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.90,0:00:08.86,Title,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\fs80\pos(960,810)}-1888, London East End-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.60,0:00:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in 1888,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jack the Ripper stalked\Nthe streets of London,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.94,0:00:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,murdering women in the night and holding\Nthe entire city in his thrall. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he was nothing compared to\Nthe horror that the feud
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.52,0:00:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,between JoJo and D would\Nunleash upon the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.02,0:00:44.15,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sora! Koboreochita futatsu no hoshi ga
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.02,0:00:44.15,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Two stars fall from the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.02,0:00:44.15,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sora koboreochita futatsu no hoshi ga
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.23,0:00:51.82,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hikari to yami no minamo suikomareteyuku
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.23,0:00:51.82,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,One shining in the light, the other sinking into darkness
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.82,0:00:57.25,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hikiau you ni kasanaru hamon
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.82,0:00:57.25,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,A ripple drawing the two of them together
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The An An A
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.67,0:01:08.30,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hokori no michi wo yuku mono ni taiyo no michibiki wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.67,0:01:08.30,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,One will walk the path of pride and receive the sun's guidance
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.67,0:01:08.30,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hokori no michi wo yuku mono ni taiyou no michibiki wo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.78,0:01:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A. A so I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.30,0:01:14.43,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yabou no hate wo mezasu mono ni
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.30,0:01:14.43,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,One will walk the path of unbridled ambition...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.43,0:01:15.85,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ikenie wo!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.43,0:01:15.85,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Demanding sacrifice!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.43,0:01:15.85,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ikenie wo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.74,0:01:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not me. It's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.92,0:01:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.69,0:01:26.57,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Furueru hodo kokoro moetsukiru hodo atsuku
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.69,0:01:26.57,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Let that burning in your soul calm the trembling of your heart
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.57,0:01:29.90,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sono te kara hanate kodou
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.57,0:01:29.90,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Strike down your fears,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.62,0:01:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.90,0:01:33.36,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Karada minagiru yuki de
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.90,0:01:33.36,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,With courage coursing through your veins!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.90,0:01:33.36,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Karada minagiru yuuki de
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.36,0:01:40.04,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mayoi naki kakugo ni kassai wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.36,0:01:40.04,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,You cannot overcome your pain unless you can accept...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.36,0:01:40.04,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mayou naki kakugo ni kassai wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.04,0:01:44.04,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sono chi no sadame!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.04,0:01:44.04,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,The legacy of your bloodline!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.04,0:01:44.04,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sono chi no sadame
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.04,0:01:47.84,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,JoJo!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.04,0:01:47.84,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
