Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.62,0:03:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ball lands safe in\Nthe hands of Diobrando!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.63,0:03:14.67,SFXPurp,6,0,0,0,,{=73}{\bord8.9\fscx118.65\fscy98.87\fade(255,0,255,-3090,-3090,-560,40)\frz349.1\pos(539.73,720.41)}Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.68,0:03:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still anyone's game!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.76,0:03:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can he make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.42,0:03:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He dodges one, and another!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.18,0:03:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.40,0:03:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing left between Dio and the\Ntry line, and still he gives it his all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.84,0:03:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the last play, they snatched\Nvictory out of the doors of defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What teamwork!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Jojo and Dio work together,\Nthere's nothing they can't do!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell of a pass, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All for naught if you hadn't\Nrun it in like you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:54.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watching you drag those defenders,\NI couldn't just let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.14,0:03:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having finished his studies, Dio is\Nset to graduate with top marks in law.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.00,0:04:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, meanwhile, has set the faculty\Nafire with his bold thesis on archaeology.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.18,0:04:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On and off the field, these\Ntwo young men are giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.62,0:04:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the pride of our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.78,0:04:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, I think we should tell our father\Nabout this victory of ours at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.88,0:04:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been seven years now since my\Nfather welcomed Dio into our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.00,0:04:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven long years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I smile and treat him as a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.94,0:04:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in my heart, nothing can\Nbe further from the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.30,0:04:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's nothing if not affable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.98,0:04:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And smart as a whip.
