Dialogue: 2,0:04:39.76,0:04:40.18,SFXFlashback2,A2,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur1.3\frz356.9\pos(1340.67,788.8)\4a&HFF&}Crack
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I just can't forgive him\Nfor his early villainies?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.90,0:04:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio, might you give us a quote\Nabout your friendship with Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.58,0:04:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem quite close.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.72,0:04:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right about the team, all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, tell us how close you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:04:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.04,0:05:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friendship, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.26,0:05:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is, I despise\Nthis grinning imbecile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.06,0:05:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've spent seven years making\Nnice to that Joestar brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now that I am of age!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall bring my plans to fruition.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.26,0:05:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At long last, the Joestar\Nfortune will be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.32,0:05:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And devil take anyone\Nwho tries to stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.90,0:05:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, how are you feeling today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for this cough, much\Nimproved over yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The doctors say I should\Nbe in the hospital! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.08,0:05:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fear it would do you no good
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.08,0:05:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hospitals only care about profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.04,0:05:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'd measure you for a\Nshroud ere they saw you cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.04,0:05:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then here I shall remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.70,0:05:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The comforts of home are\Ncurative like as not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.36,0:05:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My chest doesn't pain me so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.40,0:05:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the swelling has gone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on the mend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.68,0:06:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why has it worsened so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.06,0:06:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard tell of your victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.16,0:06:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stunning bit of teamwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone told you about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.00,0:06:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got word straight away\Nfrom an old college chum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.60,0:06:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever he is, he's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.44,0:06:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad he wasn't on our opponent's\Nteam or we could have lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.90,0:06:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you, lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You both turned out so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.06,0:06:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Providence is too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.10,0:06:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio, I'm so glad you've thrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.44,0:06:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pursue your ambitions,\Nwhatever they may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.02,0:06:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will lend you aid in\Nany way I can, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.80,0:06:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You rescued me from calamity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.26,0:06:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Already my debt is more\Nthan I can ever repay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.68,0:06:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do me too much honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The secret is mine alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.02,0:07:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine for what purpose this\Nmask may have been fashioned, or by whom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.96,0:07:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it belonged to my mother, and\Nso having it near is a comfort,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.24,0:07:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strange as that may seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I finally outwit\Nthe sphinx of a mask,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it will be the talk of\Nthe archaeological world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness!
