Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.54,0:07:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Many thanks to you, Master Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.30,0:07:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The years betray me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Climbing the stairs is much\Nharder than it was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.42,0:07:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having read it, all has been made clear!
