Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.06,0:07:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.32,0:07:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.52,0:07:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.52,0:07:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's father's medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's due for his next dosage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.70,0:08:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this time, you're the one\Nwho's been bringing it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, what of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father sent it to mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.96,0:08:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess what it says.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.52,0:08:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your lordship, sickness\Nhas laid me right low.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.34,0:08:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the end of me, whatever it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.36,0:08:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My chest hurts,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.90,0:08:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my fingers are all swollen up, and I\Ncan't breathe but for all this coughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are the same symptoms as father's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.96,0:08:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blow for blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way is this mere coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.19,0:08:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to say, Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.32,0:08:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm having a doctor look at this powder.
