Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, if you think I would poison father,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.64,0:08:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then from this day forward,\Nyou and I are friends no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.84,0:08:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try as I might, I can't\Nlook Dio in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:08:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because I lack proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I have to go on are my suspicions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.78,0:09:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, if you put that\Nmedicine back on the tray,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.78,0:09:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be willing to forget\Nabout your lapse in judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.54,0:09:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio, there's only one way\Nyou're going to convince me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.76,0:09:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swear to me that the\Ncontents of this are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.16,0:09:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it in Dario's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.94,0:09:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swear to me on Dario's\Nhonor as a gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.78,0:09:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do that and I'll never\Nbring up this moment again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.72,0:09:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If my hunch proves true,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.94,0:09:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his father's honor is the one lie\Nthat will catch in his throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.06,0:09:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.97,0:09:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.12,0:09:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I... swear...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.40,0:09:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I swear on the honor\Nof a man who didn't have any?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.80,0:09:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He deserved to die!
