Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.66,0:09:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that for the truth, Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.16,0:09:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just gave me all\Nthe proof I needed, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.56,0:09:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At hearing his name, you lashed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.32,0:10:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what he could have done\Nthat moved you to such murderous rage,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.26,0:10:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but murder him you surely did!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.80,0:10:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hurt father never again, Dio!
