Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.72,0:10:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.76,0:10:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been planning to\Nmurder him for years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.26,0:10:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.17,0:10:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that you were playing Foss with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.18,0:10:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now your villainy is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.88,0:10:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I've learned what this is, I'm\Ntaking it to the police straight away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.16,0:10:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their fortune was within my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it fate that Jojo\Nfound out when he did?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.10,0:10:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.01,0:10:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it was that letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.70,0:10:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He vexes me, even now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.68,0:10:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're weak, just like your mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.38,0:11:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He drove her to an early grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.84,0:11:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing that curse blood flows through\Nmy veins, it's enough to drive me mad!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.02,0:11:05.19,Secondary,Dario,0,0,0,,{\an8}Booze, bring me my damn booze!
