Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.66,0:11:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be back from London\Nin a few days, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.10,0:11:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till then, accept medicine only from the\Nhands of these doctors and no one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.72,0:11:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Jojo said he doesn't\Nwant me to bring it up? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.78,0:11:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will do as Jojo has instructed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His reasons are a mystery to me,\Nbut I trust the boy with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.98,0:11:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, his illness is getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.58,0:11:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it is a poison, he\Nmay need an antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you may learn in\NLondon about the poison,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you take the\Ntruth of it to your grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.48,0:12:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your death will be the perfect crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.24,0:12:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven years ago, this\Nmask reacted to my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The spikes hidden within will\Nmake short work of Jojo's brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.76,0:12:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His injuries will be so unique, there'll\Nbe nothing at all to tie it back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.74,0:12:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, your curiosity will\Nlead to your destruction.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.40,0:12:33.07,Title,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\fs80\pos(960,812)\bord3\blur2}-2 days later, London-
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.40,0:12:33.07,Title,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\fs80\pos(960,812)}-2 days later, London-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.04,0:12:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The university couldn't identify\Nthis so-called medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.98,0:12:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though they did speculate that it\Nwas a compound from the Orient.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.63,0:12:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young Master, that stretch\Nof road there is Ogre Street,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the most dangerous\Nalleyway in all of London.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.70,0:12:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.80,0:12:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is the one place I will\Nbe able to find what I came for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.52,0:13:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're more than welcome to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.14,0:13:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio grew up in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.02,0:13:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where else in England could\Nhe have acquired such a toxin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.86,0:13:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall have my evidence\Nand Father's Antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.32,0:13:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another dead end.
