Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.08,0:13:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That cat, it was eating a puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.94,0:13:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do the honors, Tattoo. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.28,0:13:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use that shiv of yours to slice him open.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.72,0:13:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want his guts for garters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.14,0:13:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogre street, it is aptly named.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.44,0:13:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check out this idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.96,0:13:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He grabbed my blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In all my days, I've never seen the like!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.98,0:13:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stuck, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.12,0:13:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One quick yank of the\Nknife and I'll be picking
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.18,0:13:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your fingers out of the\Nsnow for a fortnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.64,0:13:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.76,0:14:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment you pull,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.22,0:14:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my foot will kick out at your groin\Nwith all the force of a sledgehammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.12,0:14:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to see our\Ntransaction through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.46,0:14:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you, Zero?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.37,0:14:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fighting to protect my family\Nfrom those who wish it harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt very much that your\Nresolve is equal to mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's quite enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.84,0:14:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now tell me, one of you, where can I\Nfind an Asian apothecary? Tough talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.78,0:14:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're looking to lose\Nbody parts, do stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.50,0:14:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.88,0:14:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll mince you right finally,\Nwith the tip of the hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.48,0:14:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now we dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.10,0:14:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find that\Napothecary, no matter the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me this is\Nyour first proper dust-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.02,0:14:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you mean to block like that,\Nit'll be your last one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.32,0:15:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut you straight to the bone, looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.94,0:15:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granted, I didn't think you'd\Nhooved the shiv at me like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.86,0:15:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but my Cheap still hit its mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.18,0:15:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I know why he weren't\Ndefending himself better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.08,0:15:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fingers, hands, legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.86,0:15:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He don't care one whit what he loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.20,0:15:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as if his resolve runs\Ndeeper than pain or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.90,0:15:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took the lad for an easy mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.84,0:15:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I've been right,\Ndisabused of that notion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.28,0:15:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.19,0:15:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo went to Ogre Street on his own?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told him it was perilous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep this to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.86,0:15:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Joestar is still unwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I won't need to\Nuse the mask after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.42,0:15:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, alone, his fate is sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.90,0:16:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough, lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.48,0:16:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let a single one of you lay\Na finger on that gentleman there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.08,0:16:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.40,0:16:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strong as a bull you\Nare, it's plain to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.42,0:16:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have stove my head\Nin with that foot of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you went easy on me, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.88,0:16:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came here for the sake of my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.08,0:16:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People who expect you to\Nreturn from this dark business?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.88,0:16:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is not my place to cause them grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.14,0:16:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He means it, don't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.52,0:16:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How this Fool survived so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.64,0:16:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.66,0:16:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He spared my mate's lives\Njust like he did mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.60,0:16:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like the cut of his jib.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.28,0:16:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure he's naive, but he's a gentleman\Nthrough and through this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know the name\Nof him who spared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.36,0:16:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jonathan Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.34,0:17:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, pleased to make your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's Asian concoctions you're\Nlooking for, mind your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.00,0:17:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The druggist is one sly customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Joestar, Jojo has been gone three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.56,0:17:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever his errand, he'll accomplish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.26,0:17:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where have the years gone, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.28,0:17:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's grown into a fine man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.46,0:17:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot help but wonder if I was\Ntoo hard on the boy growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.34,0:17:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Jojo's laying\Ndead in some alley by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.64,0:17:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he find the apothecary?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.34,0:17:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at me, swilling it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.24,0:17:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing but a drunken fool, just\Nlike my bastard father, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.56,0:17:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch yourself, or have you no\Nrespect for your elders, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:18:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the baby, tolling\Nround past bedtime,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.54,0:18:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sucking on a bottle like\Nit was his mother's tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.88,0:18:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the man when he's talking,\Ndidn't your old man teach you right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.70,0:18:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, just for that, I'm\Ngonna take your face clean off ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.58,0:18:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, your threat has me quaking\Nin my boots, you old guttersnipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How will I escape this\Nmoment of mortal peril?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.44,0:18:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about we use this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.06,0:18:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's meant for Jojo, but\Nyou'll make a fine guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.32,0:18:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just die already!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.58,0:18:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, let's see what you can do?
