Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.48,0:20:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even now he advances, but his\Nhand, does the pain mean nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.34,0:20:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He shattered my shoulder\Nwith but a glancing blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.66,0:20:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The river, I must jump in.
