Dialogue: 2,0:20:26.25,0:20:26.29,SFXPurp5,19.4,0,0,0,,{=95}{\blur0.6\bord0\fscx150\fscy100\frz7.433\pos(339,8)\4a&HFF&}Thump
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.86,0:20:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was drinking through the night, but\Nsuddenly I got such a brutal thirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.30,0:20:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.78,0:20:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's draining it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.98,0:20:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.30,0:20:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the secret of the mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.24,0:20:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.28,0:20:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.32,0:20:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had such plans!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.88,0:20:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must my last sight on Earth\Nbe this damnable sunrise?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.84,0:21:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun destroyed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.14,0:21:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.80,0:21:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it so bloody dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.46,0:21:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.50,0:21:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a poisoner, Dio Brando.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.92,0:21:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have all the proof I\Nrequire, and then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.80,0:22:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.18,0:22:12.77,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.02,0:22:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The words will make you out and out.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.77,0:22:16.31,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The words will make you out 'n' out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.18,0:22:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.31,0:22:21.65,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.38,0:22:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.65,0:22:24.32,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.28,0:22:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.32,0:22:28.83,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.72,0:22:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.25,0:22:39.88,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.00,0:22:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They make the children really ring.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.88,0:22:43.43,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They make the children really ring
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.22,0:22:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spend the day your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.43,0:22:48.76,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.38,0:22:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cold in morning driving through the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.76,0:22:51.39,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.38,0:22:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.39,0:22:55.40,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.96,0:22:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then out around the lake.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.40,0:22:57.81,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.74,0:23:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's come out of the sky.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.07,0:23:01.28,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.28,0:23:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they'll stand there.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.28,0:23:03.07,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,and they stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When my lover will be there.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.20,0:23:09.87,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,One mile over we'll be there and we'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.22,0:23:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.32,0:23:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten true summers.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.62,0:23:16.33,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Ten true summers we'll be there and laughing too
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.86,0:23:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.77,0:23:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laughing too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.88,0:23:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twenty-four and five.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.09,0:23:22.71,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Twenty-four before my love you'll see I'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.64,0:23:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lover will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.82,0:23:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.71,0:23:26.01,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,There with you
