Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.51,0:23:28.51,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,700)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.30,0:23:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, I've been a devil,\Nbut grant me this one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.04,0:23:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This fellow reeks of brimstone and blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.22,0:23:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I am about to\Nbecome so much more! Dio!
